    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Evening practice. The golden light through the windows makes everything look warmer than it feels.",
      "next": "n4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hanami is at the keyboard, playing a soft melody. Her fingers move with effortless grace.",
      "next": "n6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/piano_chord.wav",
      "volume": 0.4,
      "next": "n7"
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "slide_right",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "slide_left",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n9"
    },
    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "happy",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n10"
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "happy",
      "text": "Hanami, that sounds beautiful! What piece is that?",
      "next": "n11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "Just something I've been working on. It's not finished yet.",
      "next": "n12"
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "It's lovely, Hanami. But let's focus on the festival setlist. We need to nail the opening number.",
      "next": "n13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Everyone takes their positions. Hanami's hands hover over the keys.",
      "next": "n14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The first few bars are beautiful. Hanami leads the melody, and for a moment everything clicks.",
      "next": "n15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then, mid-phrase, Hanami's fingers stumble. A wrong note rings out.",
      "next": "n16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n16",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/piano_chord.wav",
      "volume": 0.8,
      "next": "n17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n17",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "sad",
      "text": "Sorry, I... I just lost my place for a second...",
      "next": "n18"
    },
    {
      "id": "n18",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She reaches for her sheet music but her hand is shaking. The pages scatter across the floor.",
      "next": "n19"
    },
    {
      "id": "n19",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "shake_screen",
      "intensity": 3,
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n20"
    },
    {
      "id": "n20",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hanami sways on the bench. Her face has gone pale.",
      "next": "n21"
    },
    {
      "id": "n21",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "sad",
      "text": "I'm... I'm fine, I just need a...",
      "next": "n22"
    },
    {
      "id": "n22",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "shake_screen",
      "intensity": 5,
      "duration": 0.8,
      "next": "n23"
    },
    {
      "id": "n23",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hanami collapses. She slides off the bench and crumples to the floor.",
      "next": "n24"
    },
    {
      "id": "n24",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "HANAMI!",
      "next": "n25"
    },
    {
      "id": "n25",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Hanami!",
      "next": "n26"
    },
    {
      "id": "n26",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Everyone rushes to her side. She's conscious but barely.",
      "next": "n27"
    },
    {
      "id": "n27",
      "type": "if",
      "condition": "flags.asked_hanami_concern == true",
      "trueNode": "n28_knew",
      "falseNode": "n28_shocked"
    },
    {
      "id": "n28_knew",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "sad",
      "text": "I'm sorry... I should have told you all sooner. I've been... having these episodes for a while now.",
      "next": "n29_knew"
    },
    {
      "id": "n29_knew",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "I had a feeling something was wrong. You should have said something.",
      "next": "n30_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n28_shocked",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "What just happened? Has this happened before?",
      "next": "n29_shocked"
    },
    {
      "id": "n29_shocked",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "sad",
      "text": "It's... it's nothing. I just forgot to eat today, that's all.",
      "next": "n30_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n30_converge",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "suprised",
      "text": "Hanami, why didn't you say anything? We would have stopped!",
      "next": "n31"
    },
    {
      "id": "n31",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tiffany's composure cracks. Her hands are trembling. For a moment, she looks less like a leader and more like a scared girl.",
      "next": "n32"
    },
    {
      "id": "n32",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "I... I should have noticed. I was so focused on the music that I...",
      "next": "n33"
    },
    {
      "id": "n33",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "...",
      "next": "n34"
    },
    {
      "id": "n34",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cassian has gone completely still. He's staring at Hanami with an expression you've never seen on him before. Something distant. Something haunted.",
      "next": "n35"
    },
    {
      "id": "n35",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "crying",
      "text": "Is she going to be okay? Should we call someone? I don't know what to do!",
      "next": "n36"
    },
    {
      "id": "n36",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Stay with Hanami",
          "target": "n37_stay"
        },
        {
          "text": "Go get help",
          "target": "n37_help"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n37_stay",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "I'm staying right here. Hanami, can you hear me? Just focus on my voice.",
      "next": "n38_stay_trust"
    },
    {
      "id": "n38_stay_trust",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_variable",
      "variable": "hanami_trust",
      "value": 1,
      "op": "add",
      "next": "n39_stay"
    },
    {
      "id": "n39_stay",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "sad",
      "text": "Thank you... I'm okay. Really. Just give me a minute.",
      "next": "n40_stay"
    },
    {
      "id": "n40_stay",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Cassian, go find a teacher. Laura, get some water.",
      "next": "n42_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n37_help",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "I'll go find the nurse. Someone stay with her!",
      "next": "n38_help"
    },
    {
      "id": "n38_help",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/hallway/evening1.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n39_help"
    },
    {
      "id": "n39_help",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You sprint down the hallway. Your footsteps echo off the empty walls.",
      "next": "n40_help"
    },
    {
      "id": "n40_help",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "By the time you return with help, Hanami is sitting up, color slowly returning to her face.",
      "next": "n41_help"
    },
    {
      "id": "n41_help",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/club3/evening1.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n42_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n42_converge",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_flag",
      "flag": "flags.hanami_collapsed",
      "value": true,
      "next": "n43"
    },
    {
      "id": "n43",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The nurse checks on Hanami and says she needs rest. Practice is over.",
      "next": "n44"
    },
    {
      "id": "n44",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "sad",
      "text": "I'm sorry, everyone. I didn't mean to worry you.",
      "next": "n45"
    },
    {
      "id": "n45",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Don't apologize. Just... take care of yourself. Please.",
      "next": "n46"
    },
