    },
    {
      "id": "n52",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That night, you can't stop thinking about the way Hanami fell. The way Cassian froze. The way Tiffany's mask slipped.",
      "next": "n53"
    },
    {
      "id": "n53",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Something is wrong. Not just with Hanami. With all of them.",
